Description: ParsLinux AMD and Intel graphics driver installer and GPU manager
 A graphical tool that helps you configure AMD Radeon and Intel GPU drivers
 on ParsLinux. It detects your hardware, manages Vulkan layers (RADV/ANV),
 hardware video acceleration (VA-API/QuickSync), and manages hybrid graphics
 on laptops.
